  "changes": {
    "000640-000643": "MCP, Metis, Treasury, Platon and oracle_platon mirror deny tokenless TCP by default, including arbitrary same-UID relays. LOCAL_RELAY explicitly trusts local TCP; missing proc also requires LOCAL_UNVERIFIED. Configured credentials, production restrictions, peer/Host/Origin/forwarding guards preserved. Removed process-name/listener heuristic.",
    "000644": "Shared failures delay a submitted login once, using a bounded monotonic deadline. Other failures cannot extend it; operator password is checked after its own delay. Own IP/session lockout rechecked after waiting; known recent-IP exemption retained."
  },
  "behavior_change": "HTTP users should configure their package API/client/steer token. Keyless local development now requires explicit LOCAL_RELAY trust; platforms without proc additionally require LOCAL_UNVERIFIED. MCP stdio is unchanged.",
